          ["Maximum Mean Discrepancy (MMD)", "High-dimensional embeddings / images", "$\\| \\mathbb{E}[\\phi(X)] - \\mathbb{E}[\\phi(Y)] \\|_{\\mathcal{H}}$", "Permutation test threshold", "Kernel-based non-parametric two-sample test"]
